   *
   * This operation creates a new project membership record that links an employee to a specific project, defining their participation level as either 'member' or 'project-lead'. Members can view project tasks and log time against the project, while project leads have additional capabilities to manage tasks within their assigned projects including creating, editing, and reassigning tasks.
